  "card": "PR 35561 moves compact block relay flags and preferred download status from CNodeState to Peer as atomic variables, and converts the m_num_preferred_download_peers counter into an atomic integer. This eliminates several acquisitions of cs_main in net_processing message handling and compact block dispatch. The change is an internal refactoring aimed at reducing cs_main contention and preventing potential lock inversion in P2P processing. It has no external dependencies.",
